  "result": "Excellent! All 329 tests now pass. \u2705 The bulk discount feature is fully implemented and tested. Here's what was completed:\n\n## Summary\n\n**Bulk Discount Feature Implemented:**\n- Lines with 10+ units automatically get an additional 2.5% discount\n- This discount is applied **after** the line's regular discount (or tier discount)\n- VAT is calculated on the amount **after both** discounts are applied\n- The discount field in `invoiceTotals` includes both regular and bulk discounts\n\n**Changes Made:**\n\n1. **src/totals.js** \u2014 Updated calculation functions:\n   - `lineDiscount()` \u2014 Now includes both regular and bulk discount (2.5% of amount after regular discount if qty >= 10)\n   - `lineVat()` \u2014 Now calculates VAT on the amount after both discounts\n\n2. **test/totals.test.js** \u2014 Added 9 new tests specifically for bulk discount:\n   - Tests for qty < 10 (no bulk discount)\n   - Tests for qty >= 10 (gets bulk discount)\n   - Tests for bulk discount with regular discounts and VAT\n   - Tests showing bulk discount reduces the VAT base\n\n3. **Updated all existing tests** across 4 test files to reflect bulk discount behavior:\n   - test/export.test.js (5 tests)\n   - test/render.test.js (2 tests)  \n   - test/reports.test.js (9 tests)\n   - test/invoices.test.js (1 test)\n\nAll 329 tests pass with the new bulk discount feature working correctly across all modules.",
